OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of mass train stabbing
OL,4,Aadmits wounding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of a mass stabbing on a
OL,7,Ftrain in Cambridgeshire last year has
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to 12 counts of wounding
OL,9,Fwith intent.
OL,11,FPassengers and staff were injured on
OL,12,Fthe 18:25 Doncaster-London service on 1
OL,13,FNovember after it left Peterborough,
OL,14,Fcausing it to make an unscheduled stop
OL,15,Fat Huntingdon railway station.
OL,17,FAnthony Williams, 33, has denied
OL,18,Fattempted murder and is due to stand
OL,19,Ftrial next week.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
